estion!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-15T13:33:41Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Reminds me, Liverpool signed another striker this season after having already signed a striker named “Ek-i-tik-e”", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-15T13:46:09Z", "username": "Arjun", "text": "Gold Spot?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]